GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In spring, Mammoth was conquered by Riose (#52)'s host.


Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In late summer, Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) ordered an 
invasion force into the Forest province of Peachwood, owned by the 
provincial Ent chieftain.  Guerin (#18) commanded the attacking armies.  The 
defending forces were commanded by the provincial Ent chieftain.  Guerin's 
campaign accomplished the conquest of Peachwood.

